---
import HotelList from "../components/practical-info/hotels/HotelList.astro";
import Hotel from "../components/practical-info/hotels/Hotel.astro";
import CommonLayout from "../layouts/CommonLayout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import OneColumn from "../components/OneColumn.astro";
---

<CommonLayout title="Hotels" header="Hotels" withLogo>
  <Hero title="Hotels" color="yellow" />
  <OneColumn>
    <div class="markdown">
      <p>
        For convenience, we've compiled a list of hotel recommendations in and
        around Utrecht.
      </p>
      <p>
        All the distances mentioned on this page refer to the shortest path when
        walking or making use of public transport.
      </p>
      <p>
        The prices shown are an <strong>indication only</strong> and won't be kept up to date.
        Availability can change quickly; May is a popular holiday time. The prices include flexible cancellation, so lower (~ 20%) prices may be
        available for non-refundable options.
      </p>
      <p>
        For more affordable prices we included a couple of recommendations that are not in the city of Utrecht, but <a href="#around-utrecht">around Utrecht</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </OneColumn>
  <HotelList>
    <Hotel
      name="Bunk Utrecht"
      link="https://wearebunk.com/utrecht/nl/"
      image="bunk.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="16 min"
      price_range="~ €50 (shared) – €150 (private)"
      description="Trendy hotel in the centre of Utrecht. Offers facilities for meetings and families."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Holiday Inn Express"
      link="https://www.ihg.com/holidayinnexpress/hotels/nl/nl/utrecht/amsut/hoteldetail"
      image="holiday-inn-express-utrecht.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="25 min"
      price_range="~ €150"
      description="Reasonably priced hotel, 25 min from the conference venue (~ 10 min bus + walking) or a 15-min bike ride."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="2L De Blend"
      link="https://2ldeblend.nl/nl/"
      image="deblend.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="22 min"
      price_range="~ €150-175 (studio) – €200 (suite)"
      description="Hotel with studios and suites with a fully equipped kitchen. More affordable prices. Apply <strong>'RustWeek2026'</strong> for a 20% discount on studios."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Van der Valk Utrecht"
      link="https://www.vandervalkhotelutrecht.nl/"
      image="vdv.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="22 min"
      price_range="~ €200"
      description="Neat hotel slightly outside of Utrecht (on the A12); easy to reach by car. Comfortable and modern rooms. Includes a wellness centre."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Park Plaza"
      link="https://www.parkplazautrecht.nl/"
      image="park-plaza.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="9 min"
      price_range="~ €215"
      description="Trendy hotel in the centre of Utrecht. 5-10 min walk to the conference venue. Offers facilities for meetings and families."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Moxy Utrecht"
      link="https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/amsou-moxy-utrecht/overview/"
      image="moxy.avif"
      distance_kinepolis="13 min"
      price_range="~ €230"
      description="A trendy hotel with a modern vibe. Provides meeting rooms, co-working facilities and a bar."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="NH Utrecht (Jaarbeursplein)"
      link="https://www.nh-hotels.com/nl/hotel/nh-utrecht"
      image="nh-utrecht.png"
      distance_kinepolis="7 min"
      price_range="~ €240"
      description="Sleek hotel in the center of Utrecht, next to the central train station. 5-10 min walk to the conference venue."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Hampton by Hilton"
      link="https://www.hilton.com/nl/hotels/amsunhx-hampton-utrecht-central-station/"
      image="hilton.jpeg"
      distance_kinepolis="13 min"
      price_range="~ €240"
      description="Modern hotel very close to the central station of Utrecht. 10 min walk to the conference venue. Part of the Hoog Caterijne shopping complex."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Crowne Plaza"
      link="https://www.ihg.com/crowneplaza/hotels/nl/nl/utrecht/utcur/hoteldetail/"
      image="crowne-plaza.jpeg"
      distance_kinepolis="15 min"
      price_range="~ €250"
      description="Central and modern hotel close to the central station. Provides meeting rooms and a 24/7 gym."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Inntel Hotel Utrecht"
      link="https://www.inntelhotelsutrechtcentre.nl/"
      image="inntel.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="12 min"
      price_range="~ €275"
      description="Very central, more luxurious hotel, next to the central station. 10 min walk to the conference venue. "
    />
  </HotelList>
  <OneColumn>
    <div class="markdown">
      <h2 id="around-utrecht">Around Utrecht</h2>
      <p>
        Hotel prices in the city of Utrecht are quite high. If you can't find what you're looking for in Utrecht, consider staying
        in one of the surrounding cities. The <a href="/kinepolis/">conference venue</a> is just a short walk from the train station, Utrecht Centraal,
        which is very quick to reach by train from many places. 
      </p>
      <p>
        Cities close by include: Bunnik (8 minutes), Bilthoven (9 minutes), Houten (10 minutes), Amersfoort (13 minutes),
        Gouda (16 minutes), Hilversum (17 minutes), Amsterdam Zuid (22 minutes), and Schiphol Airport (33 minutes). Amersfoort is recommended, it has a beautiful old city centre much like Utrecht. 
      </p>
      <p>
        The prices listed include flexible cancellation. You may find lower prices for non-refundably options, or at smaller hotels in these cities, at ~ €100 - €120 per night.
      </p>
    </div>
    </OneColumn>
  <HotelList>
    <Hotel
      name="Amrâth Hotel Media Park Hilversum"
      link="https://www.amrathhotelmediaparkhilversum.nl/"
      image="hilversum1.png"
      distance_kinepolis="40 min"
      price_range="~ €120"
      description="Neat hotel close to the central station in Hilversum. Short commute by train to Utrecht, but on the more affordable side."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Mercure Hotel Amersfoort Centre"
      link="https://www.mercureamersfoort.nl/en"
      image="mercure-amersfoort.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="31 min"
      price_range="~ €150"
      description="Neat hotel near the station in Amersfoort. Short commute by train to Utrecht, but on the more affordable side."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Amrâth Hotel Lapershoek Arenapark"
      link="https://www.amrathhotellapershoekhilversum.nl/"
      image="hilversum-arenapark.png"
      distance_kinepolis="40 min"
      price_range="~ €150"
      description="Neat hotel close to the 'Hilversum Sportpark' station in Hilversum. Short commute by train to Utrecht, but on the more affordable side."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Postillion Utrecht Bunnik"
      link="https://www.postillionhotels.com/utrecht/"
      image="postillion-bunnik.png"
      distance_kinepolis="34 min"
      price_range="~ €150"
      description="Neat hotel close to the station in Bunnik. Short commute by train to Utrecht, but on the more affordable side."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Mercure Hotel Amersfoort Centre"
      link="https://www.mercureamersfoort.nl/en/"
      image="mercure-amersfoort.png"
      distance_kinepolis="40 min"
      price_range="~ €150"
      description="Neat hotel close to the station in Amersfoort. Short commute by train to Utrecht, but on the more affordable side."
    />
  </HotelList>
</CommonLayout>
